{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2622\ufe0f What is <i>Anomaly Protocol\u00a0</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anomaly Protocol</i> is an online co-op survival horror game set in the depths of an abandoned radiation laboratory.<br>Together with your friends, you must rescue radiation-affected survivors, gather valuable data, and complete each floor's quota to open the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every choice has a cost. As radiation spreads, not only the environment\u2014<strong>but the people\u2014begin to change</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Room..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two floors are ever the same in Anomaly Protocol.Each level and room is procedurally generated to ensure that every player experiences a new narrative.Some rooms are eerily quiet, while others seem one breath away from screaming.The system is built to keep players constantly on edge\u2014just when you feel safe, everything changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Radiation Is Not Just a Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation isn\u2019t just harmful\u2014it\u2019s intelligent.Every room has its own radiation level.Some are relatively safe, while others are immediately dangerous.And remember: The higher the radiation, the easier it is for entities to detect you.This is not just a game of reflexes\u2014it\u2019s a game of strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Earnings Have Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently working on integrating a shop system that aligns with the atmosphere and design of the game. While this feature is not yet available in the current version, it is something we hope to introduce in a future update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, I'm continuing to develop this feature with the goal of giving the in-game currency meaningful use, and shaping it based on valuable feedback from players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to make this system available as soon as it\u2019s ready to add depth and purpose to the overall experience.<br><br><strong>Can You Design Tension?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe you can.<br><i>Anomaly Protocol</i> doesn\u2019t rely on jump scares alone.<br>Sometimes silence is more terrifying than a scream.<br>Sometimes a single footstep triggers the wrong sound.<br>This isn\u2019t random\u2014everything is built to make you uncomfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe fear is not just a reaction\u2014<strong>it\u2019s a crafted experience</strong>.<br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"DAY 1 - First day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/27a7ce58cc0b4a88320dbfb1c12dcce3ac0efd7d.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 2 - No Turning Back ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/e4a2447eade33243c56eddabbcb312a64a1fc099.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 3 - hmm No Turning Back !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/863155825724162f3034e8fb7315b2c0d5620db3.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 4 - Unstoppable, i see...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/4ca00311640499c9f68b8eed1df938fadd2d64ee.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 5 - Getting Comfortable?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/b0c1361535e26e8baca0b3f14f4fb6a49e616d3e.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 6 - One More. Just One More..","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/eef46b70198603b99c807694290d7020af736b9c.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 7 - A Week of Madness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/1ace942a3ebd3f2370b5f0f3e10a39c59416a3e6.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 8 - Don't Get Too Cozy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/e401ab935c3c87637a95916879b62084de452e8d.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 9 - Death Knocked. You Didn't Answer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/e374ad7e6e1d4b78c1383d880525fef90928e845.jpg"},{"name":"DAY 10 - The Dark Doesn't Scare You. Yet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3640740/d0d6a8851800ed28eda738479b7375d37a4d34c7.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640740?t=1766716713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/708605b2a31c6c9833d8d107f72257c18ad1393c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766716713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/5baf229f5e74509231881dd4402f8fb517446734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766716713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/5baf229f5e74509231881dd4402f8fb517446734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766716713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/d6843f627aec7caacfef60f9f4625b30.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/14295501d7347c3c0f95539d06ff5cd1.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2622\ufe0f What is <i>Anomaly Protocol\u00a0</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anomaly Protocol</i> is an online co-op survival horror game set in the depths of an abandoned radiation laboratory.<br>Together with your friends, you must rescue radiation-affected survivors, gather valuable data, and complete each floor's quota to open the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every choice has a cost. As radiation spreads, not only the environment\u2014<strong>but the people\u2014begin to change</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.poster.avif?t=1766716713\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.webm?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/extras/ee65bb16018a1dc08c9ba8355bc3b1dc.mp4?t=1766716713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Room..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two floors are ever the same in Anomaly Protocol.Each level and room is procedurally generated to ensure that every player experiences a new narrative.Some rooms are eerily quiet, while others seem one breath away from screaming.The system is built to keep players constantly on edge\u2014just when you feel safe, everything changes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Radiation Is Not Just a Threat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radiation isn\u2019t just harmful\u2014it\u2019s intelligent.Every room has its own radiation level.Some are relatively safe, while others are immediately dangerous.And remember: The higher the radiation, the easier it is for entities to detect you.This is not just a game of reflexes\u2014it\u2019s a game of strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Earnings Have Purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently working on integrating a shop system that aligns with the atmosphere and design of the game. While this feature is not yet available in the current version, it is something we hope to introduce in a future update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo developer, I'm continuing to develop this feature with the goal of giving the in-game currency meaningful use, and shaping it based on valuable feedback from players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to make this system available as soon as it\u2019s ready to add depth and purpose to the overall experience.<br><br><strong>Can You Design Tension?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe you can.<br><i>Anomaly Protocol</i> doesn\u2019t rely on jump scares alone.<br>Sometimes silence is more terrifying than a scream.<br>Sometimes a single footstep triggers the wrong sound.<br>This isn\u2019t random\u2014everything is built to make you uncomfortable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe fear is not just a reaction\u2014<strong>it\u2019s a crafted experience</strong>.<br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong></strong></p>","developers":["Oriland"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640740/5c0fdcfa6c5e02d3d5e0f410d74ff354a295a137/header.jpg?t=1766716